# EPF ECR Module – Development Progress

## 1. Module Structure
- Created the `epf_ecr_export` module for EPF ECR management in Odoo 19.
- Added establishment configuration and monthly return management.
- Created member-line models for employee-wise EPF return data.

## 2. ECR Generation
- Implemented member data entry and validation.
- Added PF/EPS contribution calculation logic.
- Implemented ECR file generation with configurable format settings.
- Added ECR return status and validation workflow.

## 3. Payroll Integration
- Created the `epf_ecr_tds_bridge` module to connect EPF ECR processing with the existing TDS Payroll Management module.
- Added functionality to load employee and payroll data for a selected company and payroll period.
- Added validation for missing UAN details, duplicate records, and changes in source payroll data.

## 4. Challan and Payment Tracking
- Added fields to record challan/TRRN details.
- Implemented challan amount estimation and payment status tracking.
- Added support for recording payment references and related details.

## 5. Validation and Security
- Added validation checks for member data and ECR generation requirements.
- Implemented workflow and access-control mechanisms.
- Added initial automated test cases for calculations, validation, and workflow handling.
